{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>渲染管线</p>","expand":true,"uid":"51c84dfc-61ba-4b37-9ee7-eea5200268c0","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[{"data":{"text":"<p>光照计算</p>","uid":"2dfcc6db-a631-428b-b325-a9ba254d18e4","freeNodeTreeToMainRootOffset":[1062,-135],"expand":true,"isActive":false,"richText":true},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Forward</p>","uid":"3341911a-dbcd-4fec-99c5-207f0576d275","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>大量光源的情况下每个片元都要计算所有灯光，过于浪费</p>","uid":"9eb4fd12-26e3-44e7-85b7-36073d01e680","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Deferred</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ef2db687-dce4-4ca7-9d02-1cc1005a04e8"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>先行绘制不透明物体，写入G-buffer再计算光照。好处是只用计算可见片元的光照，坏处是内存变大， G-buffer 的读写带宽</p>","uid":"43c51649-54f7-43b0-924a-eacdba03783d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Forward+</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"38b8e307-ccad-4fb5-ba3d-f60f9767838d"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p> 先按屏幕区域筛选光源，大概确定哪些片元会受到哪些光源影响</p>","uid":"ddf04c99-c118-4dbd-88a9-436355ba2565","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>应用阶段</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"22d082fe-dc17-4b07-86c6-2be4081bb39e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>cpu 准备场景数据， 提交commandBuff</p>","uid":"3d2013aa-c01d-4aff-8267-43d1580cb6d5","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>指定颜色，深度缓冲</p>","uid":"27203f7a-9928-4227-b9a4-c70fa3644b60","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>设定图形管线</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"35ac75e2-92d0-4116-97b4-f4f8fada1fe7"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>绑定顶点缓冲和索引缓冲</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"87f78268-a56a-455b-a586-adac9fca0819"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>绑定纹理</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7bc25afc-0fec-41d4-8727-b26807dfbd0c"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>绘制物体</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"de5bacfc-496a-45f0-b4cb-24e73aca67e3"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>结束渲染</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"1700dce9-4454-4f71-841d-e1b31cb8730d"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>提交commandBuffer</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"002c516a-6911-4b83-b438-b198294d6337"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>几何阶段</p>","uid":"69820321-0ebf-4abe-b755-d01e2cbff13d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点装配</p>","uid":"fbab7be0-a4c9-4993-9471-635615cbe059","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>读取顶点和索引，生成点，线，三角形</p>","uid":"b8a22b06-b7dc-4fb1-9b0f-69c1324ce163","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点着色器</p>","uid":"d5315e70-6f83-4073-9055-d1ff20aa4166","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>MVP 变化，把物体从模型空间转到裁剪空间</p>","uid":"f9bbcab5-b0d8-4b31-b9a4-5e8374531317","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>模型变化：模型坐标-&gt; 世界坐标</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7841592b-0de5-44be-a09d-f8fb4d837b43"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>视图变化：世界坐标-&gt; 观察空间。 相机为0，朝向-z的坐标</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"bb4d0d75-66aa-401f-810b-7d1f9fcb5314"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>投影变化：观察空间-&gt; 裁剪空间，得到齐次坐标</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8d7ac9d8-c775-4762-81d8-4a4b3d891969"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>细分着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4bbd873e-fb7e-45cd-beb1-2162cd89e882"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>外壳着色器：提供顶点和细分参数</p>","uid":"9072458c-4af1-4cd1-80f2-3140836917f6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>细分器：根据细分级别生成细分后的坐标和拓扑</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"57d5fe51-8a50-4d07-baa7-3bcef589028e"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>域着色器：根据控制点数据和细分器给出的域坐标，计算新的顶点的位置和属性</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"30c63882-d0b8-42c3-869a-0c634812cc9b"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>输入顶点，输出图元。常用于动态控制细分级别</p>","uid":"403a6a42-9876-4087-962c-f9a00444910a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>几何着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"784cb22e-7a8f-462e-b6b3-e2b0890526ab"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>输入图元，输出图元。增删改图元</p>","uid":"8ba5b3d0-f3cd-4295-b9fc-a6408cb9ad0b","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>裁剪</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"739ad1c6-be46-4a12-91ab-d01684e5463e"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>视锥体外的图元部分</p>","uid":"deb101f9-346f-4dab-b74a-299d0f36bcaf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>NDC</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"255d72f1-b5ae-4720-b6b0-2f2db9b6bf16"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>齐次坐标，除以w分量。归一化到一个标准的空间里</p>","uid":"3476ce6e-7ee0-4d16-8d99-7e72bc0fbd9c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>视口变换</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"20726014-51f0-459e-8228-1a80cb4d7baa"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>用来把NDC里的坐标转为屏幕坐标</p>","uid":"9ae04ec1-b3f8-44c9-a101-6a2f24dbecd0","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>光栅化</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"585e1f5a-6a44-42e0-a014-8b3ed5309968"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>光栅化</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"2b6ec100-cf45-4d70-9293-2bb702e7e218"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>固定的管线。三角形设置，三角形遍历</p>","uid":"b8515cca-c894-4efb-a0e0-d22deaae288f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>像素处理</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4a862d12-cd44-43ef-a1fc-9320471f9302"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>片元着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8b0ab9b9-8e1f-434d-916e-a26bc5f4efb5"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>对每个片元进行操作，采样材质也一般发生在这一步</p>","uid":"ca3a7ea2-5f65-4cd7-b903-bec6d85e47fd","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>深度测试，模板测试。有需要也可以提前</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4760033f-e308-4657-87c6-ddcb562cc01e"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>输出到frameBuffer</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"923dd87f-99be-4ced-b8c5-611ed809f54e"},"children":[]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"code","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-1086.2500000000005,"translateY":-96.75000000000011,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"e":-1086.2500000000005,"f":-96.75000000000011},"state":{"scale":1,"x":-1086.2500000000005,"y":-96.75000000000011,"sx":-1097.2500000000005,"sy":-176.7500000000001}}}